      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The statement 'I am fine' takes the tag 'aren't I?' instead of 'amn't I?'.",
        "Words with negative meaning like 'hardly', 'scarcely', 'seldom', and 'barely' take a positive tag.",
